# AI Traffic Management System - Design Document

## 1. System Architecture

### 1.1 High-Level Architecture
```
┌─────────────┐      HTTP      ┌──────────────┐      ┌─────────────┐
│   Browser   │ ◄────────────► │   FastAPI    │ ◄───►│ YOLOv8 Model│
│  (Frontend) │                │   Backend    │      │  (best.pt)  │
└─────────────┘                └──────────────┘      └─────────────┘
```

### 1.2 Component Overview
- **Frontend**: Single HTML page with JavaScript for image upload and result display
- **Backend**: FastAPI application with endpoints for detection
- **Model Layer**: YOLOv8 model loaded at startup for vehicle detection
- **Business Logic**: Traffic light timing calculation based on vehicle count

## 2. Project Structure

```
ai-traffic-management/
├── backend/
│   ├── main.py                 # FastAPI application entry point
│   ├── models.py               # Pydantic models for request/response
